# Always assert on retrieved content itself in tests (preference)

Standing user preference: Always assert on retrieved content itself in tests — a version-bump assertion alone is a false green when retrieval status is degraded; verify that content was actually retrievable, not just that a version counter changed.

## Conventions
- Always assert on retrieved content itself in tests — a version-bump assertion alone is a false green when retrieval status is degraded; verify that content was actually retrievable, not just that a version counter changed.

